  THE PREREQUISITE FAILS, AND IT NAMES WHICH UNKNOWN. A derived index
  across FOUR contexts does not produce a two-bit code: self reads
  +42.1/+12.3 Hz against 4.3/8.9 of error.

  AND THE ORACLE ARM CLEARS (+81.0/+148.8 Hz), so the production is fine
  and the LIMIT IS THE DERIVED INDEX AT FOUR CONTEXTS. That names its own
  lever: DNA v70's conscience gain sharpens exactly this partition and
  just closed 68% of the oracle gap at TWO contexts. Re-run with it on
  before concluding anything about four.
